这也为州长的登场做好了绝佳的铺垫。

802
00:37:27.520 --> 00:37:27.880
Hmm.
嗯。

803
00:37:28.620 --> 00:37:29.980
Well, Jim's very excited.
吉姆非常兴奋。

804
00:37:29.980 --> 00:37:32.180
He gives a big woo-hoo when he gets off the phone.
他挂了电话后，高兴地大喊了一声。

805
00:37:32.780 --> 00:37:34.580
He's on a sales streak.
他的销售势头正劲。

806
00:37:34.900 --> 00:37:35.300
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

807
00:37:35.580 --> 00:37:42.780
But when he goes to talk to Kevin about it, even though Kevin has done da-da-da-da, his commission is zero.
但当他去找凯文谈这件事时，尽管凯文业绩斐然，他的佣金却是零。

808
00:37:43.700 --> 00:37:45.940
Angela's going to say to Jim, you've met your commission cap.
安吉拉会对吉姆说，你的佣金已经达到上限了。

809
00:37:46.160 --> 00:37:48.800
You don't get any more commission for the rest of the month.
这个月的剩下的时间里你再也拿不到任何佣金了。

810
00:37:49.060 --> 00:37:59.680
I'm going to say something now that is going to come across to most listeners and most every viewer of the office as a sort of, like, welcome to the party, Jenna, remark.
我现在要说的话，在大多数听众和《办公室》的每一位观众听来，可能会觉得像是一句“欢迎加入，珍娜”式的评论。

811
00:38:00.240 --> 00:38:00.720
What?
什么？

812
00:38:01.340 --> 00:38:08.800
But I just noticed, I just noticed in this scene with Kevin how Angela has taken up all the space on the top of the partition.
但我刚刚注意到，我刚在这场与凯文的对手戏中注意到，安吉拉占满了隔板顶部的所有空间。

813
00:38:09.260 --> 00:38:09.680
Yeah.
对。

814
00:38:10.240 --> 00:38:11.400
Every item is hers.
每一样东西都是她的。

815
00:38:11.760 --> 00:38:12.000
Yeah.
对。

816
00:38:12.360 --> 00:38:14.140
There's nothing of Kevin's up there.
上面没有一样东西是凯文的。

817
00:38:14.200 --> 00:38:14.400
No.
没错。

818
00:38:14.660 --> 00:38:18.540
It's like the more things she puts up there, the less she has to see Kevin or something.
这就好像她放上去的东西越多，她就越不用看见凯文一样。

819
00:38:19.200 --> 00:38:19.760
Exactly.
完全正确。

820
00:38:19.980 --> 00:38:24.160
