每个人投资的原因各不相同.

862
00:40:19.580 --> 00:40:22.400
Stanley wants a decommissioned lighthouse.
斯坦利想要一个退役的灯塔.

863
00:40:23.320 --> 00:40:23.400
Yeah.
对.

864
00:40:23.400 --> 00:40:26.640
He wants to live at the top, and nobody will know he lives there.
他想住在顶层，而且没人知道他住在那里.

865
00:40:26.780 --> 00:40:30.820
And then there's a button that he can press, and it launches the lighthouse into space.
然后有一个他可以按下的按钮，能把灯塔发射到太空中.

866
00:40:31.140 --> 00:40:31.560
Mm-hmm.
嗯.

867
00:40:31.920 --> 00:40:32.760
He's serious.
他是认真的.

868
00:40:33.880 --> 00:40:35.660
He wants to live in a lighthouse.
他想住在灯塔里.

869
00:40:35.980 --> 00:40:37.500
That is also a spaceship.
那同时也是个宇宙飞船.

870
00:40:37.940 --> 00:40:38.080
What?
什么?

871
00:40:39.520 --> 00:40:42.700
Other people also share why they did or didn't inveSt.
其他人也分享了他们投资或不投资的原因.

872
00:40:42.980 --> 00:40:48.360
In the shooting draft, Phyllis had a talking head explaining why she did not inveSt.
在拍摄剧本中，菲利斯有一个单人访谈，解释了她为什么不投资.

873
00:40:48.360 --> 00:40:48.840
Oh.
哦.

874
00:40:49.120 --> 00:40:50.400
It read like this.
内容是这样的.

875
00:40:50.940 --> 00:40:54.260
Phyllis, I invested in Bob Vance.
菲利斯，我投资了鲍勃·万斯.

876
00:40:54.560 --> 00:40:58.380
And per our prenup, I'm just five months away from vesting.
根据我们的婚前协议，我再过五个月就拿到股权了.

877
00:40:58.860 --> 00:40:59.600
Wow.
哇.

878
00:41:00.060 --> 00:41:00.620
Okay.
好吧.

879
00:41:01.440 --> 00:41:05.440
And then in Deleted Scenes, Daryl has a talking head of why he invested.
然后在删减片段里，达里尔有一个单人访谈，讲他为什么投资.

880
00:41:05.820 --> 00:41:06.440
Let's hear that.
我们听听看.

881
00:41:07.560 --> 00:41:08.700
Why would I invest with Ryan?
我为什么会跟瑞安投资?

882
00:41:09.240 --> 00:41:10.420
It's a really good idea.
这真的是个好主意.

883
00:41:11.580 --> 00:41:14.500
Aggregators are one of the few things that produce revenue online.
聚合器是网络上为数不多能产生收入的事物之一.

884
00:41:15.180 --> 00:41:18.260
Also, the internet has a history of rewarding annoying white boys.
而且，互联网有一向奖励烦人白人男孩的历史.

885
00:41:19.000 --> 00:41:20.220
All the ingredients are there.
所有的要素都具备了.

886
00:41:23.680 --> 00:41:28.080
Well, maybe we should take a break, because when we come back, Oscar is going to do the
嗯，也许我们该休息一下，因为等我们回来时，奥斯卡要做他

887
00:41:28.080 --> 00:41:29.280
thing he does beSt.
最擅长的事.

888
00:41:30.020 --> 00:41:31.800
He's going to piss on their parade.
他要给他们泼冷水了.

889
00:41:32.960 --> 00:41:43.250
Well, we are back.
好了，我们回来了.

890
00:41:43.470 --> 00:41:48.890
Ryan is bragging that Washington University wants to buy Woof, but he's not going to sell.
瑞安在吹嘘说华盛顿大学想收购Woof，但他不打算卖.

891
00:41:48.890 --> 00:41:53.450
Instead, he's going to open a second round of investment to family and friends, and the
相反，他打算向家人和朋友开启第二轮投资，而他们

