00:41:56.830 --> 00:41:57.310
Mistake.
犯规了.

894
00:41:57.610 --> 00:41:57.950
Mm-hmm.
嗯.

895
00:41:59.050 --> 00:41:59.530
Yeah.
对.

896
00:41:59.950 --> 00:42:01.970
Now, Oscar says something really interesting.
现在，奥斯卡说了一件非常有趣的事.

897
00:42:02.110 --> 00:42:07.470
He says, have you ever considered making Woof like an emergency notification system?
他说，你有没有考虑过把Woof做成一个紧急通知系统?

898
00:42:07.690 --> 00:42:08.330
So smart.
太聪明了.

899
00:42:08.530 --> 00:42:09.470
So smart.
太聪明了.

900
00:42:09.470 --> 00:42:11.190
What a great use of Woof.
Woof真是个绝佳的用途.

901
